5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe we should ensure our staff and volunteers are not overwhelmed. I will look into the volunteer roster and conservation staffing.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am interested in the logistics. I'll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know what actually brings people back. I'll examine the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The physical limits of the gallery are my priority. I will review the structural survey of the suspended bay and evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money goes! I'll check the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
