20,2,,status,Sakura,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
21,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
22,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
23,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
24,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems our conservation lab is severely understaffed, and our volunteers are mostly from the history circle. We must be careful.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Logistics are a mess. Paperwork delays have pushed back openings, and powered displays are prone to breaking down during gallery hours.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,May,,The data is clear: people love interactive elements and seeing people actually working in the gallery. Static cases are less popular.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and our evening hires mean we can't have fragile, open arrangements that can't be moved.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh wow! Transport costs are huge—nearly a third of installation! Also, custom mounts are getting way more expensive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, that is interesting. If people like seeing work being done, perhaps we can involve our history circle volunteers more?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, if transport is that costly, we should avoid heavy loans from distant institutions. @Misaki, does that align with the weight limits?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, Shizue. A ""living"" exhibition would be a hit. @Shion, as long as the ""action"" doesn't involve fragile electronics that break.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Yes, Shion. Heavy stonework is a risk. We need something that fits the weight cap and doesn't block the room for evening events.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"So we need something cheap to move, light on the floor, and fun to watch! This is like a puzzle!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I am worried about the conservation backlog. Whatever we pick shouldn't require much new cleaning or stabilization from the lab.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Shion,,That rules out anything with high-maintenance powered components or complex international shipping requirements.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,May,,I agree. Let's prioritize the visitor experience. Something with a human element would satisfy the comment slips.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Misaki,,And it must be structurally sound. No massive installations in the suspended bay.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"And no fancy custom mounts if we can avoid them! Let's keep the budget in the room, not in the invoices.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
